 [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Add the WRITE theme and split JOB blocks by work kind[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every past and open JOB Pomodoro carries the work-kind theme its [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]content supports (READ, WRITE, CHORE, PLAN, or BUILD) in one [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]verified, revertable vault commit. WRITE is a live, pinned theme [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]that shows in Recent. JOB is hidden. `bob themes list` reports no [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]false rename reappearances.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]write_theme_and_job_split.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/write_theme_and_job_split.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-db[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-db/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`bob themes split` and the reappearance fix[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]split_cmd[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split_cmd: add the template and map-driven per-entry theme split on the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared vault-rewrite transaction, and stop renamed_reappeared from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reporting re-adopted names, with tests and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split the live JOB blocks and add WRITE[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault_migrate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after split_cmd[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault_migrate: hide JOB, split its 89 blocks with the planned mapping in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one vault commit, pin WRITE (and the standing set), and verify list, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stats, and sync.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-db","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-db.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-9555fa6cd745ad3b2abe3ff9a2b950f2","started_at":"2026-10-27T21:12:17.071776+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1793184541,"sha":"50f6c91bc03029dc8cf0e449d8380c107d2183ff","subject":"refactor(themes): share raw-line splice verification between rename and split"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"1b9d51f6cd8b0b3187aaf5e83b0e1554979a46bd777a961d430fa3b84d59ebfc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land/commits.json","size_bytes":255},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"c335e91f6a5466e0eab7c3c6b3465d5aaf69f9a01cac8acb0a2bc1d379d5fefd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land/meta.json","size_bytes":623},"prompt":{"digest":"01ffde9852737edbc10703a10c17d332737b680c71654b8436e174716b0417b5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":201},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"a69c7e866e82cd026026a07303f64e84535dda2edf4c7cb66c5a56e6e1cf558e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4225},"state":{"digest":"723d30ab080425d19aa43490bdd7945d23b7ca9b1aabec5b843df018222a3c3b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land","local_name":"bob-cli-db.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-db","agent_clan_generation":"20261027171147","bead_